voiced story</strong><br>Tomoyo After features a fully voiced story and stars the phenomenal voice talents of Hikaru Isshiki and Yuichi Nakamura.<br><br><strong>Dungeon &amp; Takafumis</strong><br>Featuring the characters of the main story in a fantasy setting, &quot;Dungeon &amp; Takafumis&quot; is a fully-featured, comedic strategy RPG that will add hours to your experience<br><br><strong>Tomopedia</strong><br>Newly added to the English Edition, Tomopedia provides insight into Japanese culture and explanations for cultural references that you may come across in the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staff</h2><br>Game Brand: Key<br>Game Design: Jun Maeda<br>Scenario: Jun Maeda, Leo Kashida<br>Illustration: Fumio<br>Music: Shinji Orito, Magome Togoshi, Jun Maeda<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Theme song</h2><br>Title: &quot;Light colors&quot;<br>Lyrics: Jun Maeda<br>Composition: Shinji Orito<br>Arrangement: Kazuya Takase (I've)<br>Vocals: Lia",
